{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01Jh64Sdj8dMeCJmQr6biX5C", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.archives.gov.on.ca/en/explore/online/familyties/life_after_confederation.aspx\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.canada.ca/en/parks-canada/news/2016/08/george-brown-house-national-historic-site.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://pc.gc.ca/culture/designation/lieu-site/maison-george-brown-house\"}, {\"url\": \"https://parks.canada.ca/culture/designation/lieu-site/maison-george-brown-house\"}, {\"url\": \"https://thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/george-brown\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.britannica.com/print/article/81515\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.canadianpostagestamps.ca/canada/stamps/15796/hon-george-brown-1818-1880-1968-canada-postage-stamp\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/1911_Encyclop%C3%A6dia_Britannica/Brown,_George\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/fr/article/george-brown\"}, {\"url\": \"https://stampsandcanada.com/stamps-prices-canada-stamp/hon-george-brown-1818-1880/5-cents/451/1\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:34:14.038Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "George Brown 1818-1880 1875 refused knighthood", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_014e6xe96RNAeMRD6V8q42Y1", "content": [{"title": "life after confederation", "url": "https://www.archives.gov.on.ca/en/explore/online/familyties/life_after_confederation.aspx"}, {"title": "George Brown House National Historic Site", "url": "https://www.canada.ca/en/parks-canada/news/2016/08/george-brown-house-national-historic-site.html"}, {"title": "George Brown House National Historic Site", "url": "https://pc.gc.ca/culture/designation/lieu-site/maison-george-brown-house"}, {"title": "George Brown House National Historic Site", "url": "https://parks.canada.ca/culture/designation/lieu-site/maison-george-brown-house"}, {"title": "george brown", "url": "https://thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/george-brown"}, {"title": "George Brown", "url": "https://www.britannica.com/print/article/81515"}, {"title": "Name | Value |", "url": "https://www.canadianpostagestamps.ca/canada/stamps/15796/hon-george-brown-1818-1880-1968-canada-postage-stamp"}, {"title": "Jump to content", "url": "https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/1911_Encyclop%C3%A6dia_Britannica/Brown,_George"}, {"title": "george brown", "url": "https://www.thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/fr/article/george-brown"}, {"title": "Hon. George Brown, 1818-1880 - 5 cents 1968 - Canadian stamp", "url": "https://stampsandcanada.com/stamps-prices-canada-stamp/hon-george-brown-1818-1880/5-cents/451/1"}]}, "The search doesn't support a 1875 refusal of a knighthood. The sources tie the 1875 refusal to the lieutenant governorship of Ontario, and place the knighthood refusal in 1879.\n\n- **1875:** Several sources say Brown turned down the lieutenant governorship of Ontario that year. The Parks Canada plaque text puts the date on that offer (index 3-10), and The Canadian Encyclopedia gives the same year (index 5-6).\n- **Knighthood:** The knighthood refusal is dated 1879 in the Parks Canada and Canadian Encyclopedia entries (index 3-10, 5-6). The 1911 Britannica says he declined the offer on two occasions (index 8-2), and the Canadian Encyclopedia's French article agrees on 1879 (index 9-9).\n- **Dates of life:** Britannica gives his dates as November 29, 1818 to May 9, 1880 (index 6-2). The Ontario Archives says he was shot in March 1880 and died May 9 (index 1-7 to 1-10).\n\nYour query may have merged the two refusals. The likely answer is that he declined the lieutenant governorship in 1875 and a knighthood in 1879."], "durationSeconds": 5.961487750000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01Jh64Sdj8dMeCJmQr6biX5C", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
